  "body": "Seen independently in two review gates on 2026-11-09 (PR #601's review, and the #330 / PR #603 work):\n\n- `egui_app::tests::structural::shell_structure_light` failed once in a parallel `camcraft-ui --lib` run with \"frame-edge sync rode the world's reference\".\n- `shell_structure_dark` failed once in three full runs on the dark-theme assert.\n- Both pass when run alone.\n\n**Likely cause:** a test reads or writes a process-global (the theme, or the frame-edge sync state) that another test changes concurrently.\n\n**Expected:** structural tests are deterministic under the default parallel test runner. Either the global becomes per-harness state, or the tests that touch it are serialised.\n\n**Done means:** the ui lib suite passes the structural tests in 20 consecutive parallel runs.",
